msgstr "zpráva 1 >>> {\"fnum\": 123.456, \"num\": 123, \"bar\": \"baz\", \"foo\": \"bar\"}"

#: ../../howto/logging-cookbook.rst:2534 ../../howto/logging-cookbook.rst:2576
